{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016owQHBHNFoPnpXscTiD42a","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Experiment Plan — demo_calibrated_sim\n2\t# Target: EMNLP 2026 Findings (ARR deadline 2026-05-25)\n3\t# Created: 2026-05-13 (post-MVP, D013/D014)\n4\t# Story: Calibration failure taxonomy + scale-dependent failure severity\n5\t#\n6\t# Claims reference (for human readers only — tools parse per-entry 'claim' field):\n7\t#   C1: BCP produces three systematic failure mechanisms (FM1-FM3) at 7B scale\n8\t#   C2: DPO+BCP interaction produces calibration reversal (FM4)\n9\t#   C3: BCP failure severity is scale-dependent — catastrophic at 7B, selective ignoring at 14B\n10\t#   C4: Actionable implications for future calibration research\n11\t\n12\texperiments:\n13\t  # --- P0: Core experiments (all completed) ---\n14\t\n15\t  - id: plan_001\n16\t    name: \"7B BCP Baseline Evaluation\"\n17\t    claim: C1\n18\t    description: \"Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct BCP eval on tau-bench retail (6 variants × 19-20 tasks). Documents FM1 (completion collapse), FM2 (cross-dim interference), FM3 (overcorrection rebound at single-run level).\"\n19\t    priority: P0\n20\t    depends_on: []\n21\t    registry_id: mvp-004\n22\t\n23\t  - id: plan_002\n24\t    name: \"7B DPO Training (v3, Fix B)\"\n25\t    claim: C2\n26\t    description: \"DPO fine-tuning on dialect-calibrated preference pairs. Training acc 0.75-1.0, loss 0.653.\"\n27\t    priority: P0\n28\t    depends_on: []\n29\t    registry_id: dpo-003\n30\t\n31\t  - id: plan_003\n32\t    name: \"7B DPO+BCP Evaluation (merged model)\"\n33\t    claim: C2\n34\t    description: \"Evaluate DPO-trained merged model with BCP prompts (4 runs × 6 variants × 20 tasks = 480 episodes). Confirms FM3 rebound (4/4 runs). Documents FM4 reversal (10/12 gap expansion).\"\n35\t    priority: P0\n36\t    depends_on: [plan_002]\n37\t    registry_id: hgate-dpo003-merged\n38\t\n39\t  - id: plan_004\n40\t    name: \"14B BCP Cross-Scale Evaluation\"\n41\t    claim: C3\n42\t    description: \"Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct FP16 TP=2 BCP eval (4 runs × 6 variants × 20 tasks = 480 episodes). Result: FM1 NOT replicated (H3 4/4 PASS), FM3 NOT replicated (0/4 runs), FM2 weak. BCP still fails (H2 3/4 FAIL) but via 'selective ignoring' not 'catastrophic collapse'.\"\n43\t    priority: P0\n44\t    depends_on: [plan_001]\n45\t    registry_id: qwen14b-bcp-001\n46\t\n47\t  # --- P1: Evidence robustness ---\n48\t\n49\t  - id: plan_005b\n50\t    name: \"7B BCP Multi-Run Replication\"\n51\t    claim: C1\n52\t    description: \"Replicate mvp-004 (7B base BCP) 3 additional runs. Current C1 evidence (FM1/FM2) based on single run n=19-20. This brings C1 to 4 runs total, matching C2/C3 evidence strength.\"\n53\t    priority: P1\n54\t    depends_on: [plan_001]\n55\t    registry_id: bcp7b-multirun-001\n56\t    notes: \"High-value low-cost. Directly addresses Reviewer concern about FM1/FM2 variance artifact risk.\"\n57\t\n58\t  - id: plan_005\n59\t    name: \"Bootstrap CI for Key Comparisons\"\n60\t    claim: C1\n61\t    description: \"Bootstrap confidence intervals for: FM4 reversal direction, FM3 rebound magnitude, 7B-vs-14B completion difference, H2 calibration gap. Computational only.\"\n62\t    priority: P1\n63\t    depends_on: [plan_001, plan_003, plan_004]\n64\t    registry_id: bootstrap-ci-001\n65\t\n66\t  # --- P2: Optional strengthening ---\n67\t\n68\t  - id: plan_006\n69\t    name: \"14B DPO + BCP (scale-dependent FM4?)\"\n70\t    claim: C2\n71\t    description: \"DPO training + BCP eval at 14B scale. Tests whether FM4 (DPO+BCP reversal) is also scale-dependent.\"\n72\t    priority: P2\n73\t    depends_on: [plan_004]\n74\t    notes: \"Not strictly necessary — C2 already strong at 7B. Contingent on new server GPU availability post-migration.\"\n75\t\n76\t  # --- Auxiliary experiments (supporting data, not primary evidence) ---\n77\t\n78\t  - id: plan_aux_001\n79\t    name: \"Llama-3-8B BCP (floor effect)\"\n80\t    claim: C3\